      "SANDRA: Don’t open a new ranch until the old one is done.\nMAVIS: What?",
      "SANDRA: Just so you know.\nMAVIS: You want to hang out tonight? Get loaded or something?",
      "MAVIS: We’re not even supposed to do that. We’re supposed to stick to this character bible?\nBETH: Hey! Nice to see you again.\nMAVIS: You too. Wow, there it is... Adorable.\nBETH: Thank you.",
      "BETH: It’s fine, I’ll just pump and dump after the show. Don’t worry, I’m not trying to get my kid hammered.\nMAVIS: Wow, look at that.\nBETH: Ah yes, the Funquarium. Always chills her out. Yes! You love it. We’re starting to get smiles.\nMAVIS: Cute.",
      "BETH: So, how’s it going? I know you’re a writer. I saw that nice article about you in the Sun.\nMAVIS: Yes, I’m the author of a young adult series.\nMAVIS: It’s disturbingly popular.\nMAVIS: I like your decor, what is this, shabby chic?"
    ]
